Account %1 needs a password.\n\nWhen you sign in to this computer at the keyboard you need only your\nWindows password.  When you connect from another computer, over ssh or\nthrough the SD API, you need only this password.\n\nYou will be asked to type it twice.  What you type is not shown - each\ncharacter appears as a star - and Backspace corrects a mistake.\n\nA password is required.  Pressing Enter on an empty line does not give\nyou an account without one - it ends this session, and you are asked\nagain the next time you sign in.  Until this account has a password it\ncannot be used at all: not here at the keyboard, not over ssh, and not\nthrough the SD API.
